### INSTRUCTIONS ###

1) Move the WX-RADAR-CONKY directory into the USER Module directory.

2) Move the included 10_WX-RADAR-CONKY.sh script into the USER Module directory.
	- Up one level from the WX-RADAR-CONKY directory

3) Open the 10_WX-RADAR-CONKY.sh script in a text editor:
     - Modify the NWS_STATION and SIZE variables to suit your preferences.
     - Save the changes.

Notes:
- The module will be active on the next reboot or re-run of Station Setup. You may re-number it if necessary for your ordering preferences.

- To deactivate the module, place the 10_WX-RADAR-CONKY.sh script back inside the WX-RADAR-CONKY directory and reboot.

- In multi-user installations, WX-RADAR-CONKY will remain configured for a previous user, if the next user does not also use this module.
